Development provenance
----------------------

The Confluent-compatible record format was independently implemented from public documentation
and verified by comparing external output on OSO's synthetic test data. The official, unmodified
Confluent Oracle CDC Source connector was used only as a reference in disposable lab containers
under its evaluation licence. No reverse-engineered or decompiled versions of Confluent software
were used. No Confluent source code was inspected or copied. Its proprietary connector and
libraries are not included in OSO releases, downloaded by the build or run in CI.

